# Manual Deployment Guide — M03

## Path Aplikasi
`/srv/cc-m03`

## Service Management
- Status: `sudo systemctl status cc-m03`
- Restart: `sudo systemctl restart cc-m03`
- Logs: `sudo journalctl -u cc-m03 -f`

## Prosedur Update Kode
```bash
cd /srv/cc-m03
git pull
source .venv/bin/activate
pip install -r requirements.txt
sudo systemctl restart cc-m03
curl -fsS [http://127.0.0.1:8000/health](http://127.0.0.1:8000/health)
